      "content": "Here are some specific scenarios targeting different stereotypes for your training data. For East Asian employees, a manager might frequently ask if they need \"help fitting in,\" implying they are different. Regarding Black employees, a colleague might repeatedly assume they are \"too passionate\" or \"overly emotional\" during meetings. For Hispanic/Latinx employees, there might be an unwarranted assumption that they are better suited for administrative support roles rather than engineering.",
